1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:10,117
In the I U P A C system, the smaller group together with the oxygen is named as an alkoxy substituent, and the larger group is the parent chain.

2
00:00:10,117 --> 00:00:18,424
So C H three O C H two C H three: methoxy, plus ethane, gives methoxyethane.

3
00:00:18,424 --> 00:00:24,101
The common name just lists the two groups and adds the word ether: ethyl methyl ether.

